    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1440">

                <pb facs="1164" n="1048" xml:id="pg1048"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.00/1968.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-09-13T09:00:00-05:45">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 13, 1912, 9 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your September 4, 7 p.m. Being convinced of the wisdom of communicating at once,
                    I have delivered to the Foreign Office a textual copy of the Department’s
                    authorized declaration of policy, and have forwarded to Admiral Southerland
                    another copy.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Weitzel.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
